\details{
For every image point \eqn{\mathbf{p}}, the two-way travel time associated
with trace \eqn{j} is calculated as

\deqn{
t_j(\mathbf{p}) =
\frac{
  \Vert \mathbf{p} - \mathbf{s}_j \Vert +
  \Vert \mathbf{p} - \mathbf{r}_j \Vert
}{v},
